---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Главная">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> РАБОЧЕЕ ПРОСТРАНСТВО РЕКРУТЕРА</span>
      <h1>Находите тех,<br /><span>кто подходит.</span></h1>
      <p>Резюме, вакансии и подбор кандидатов — в одном понятном рабочем пространстве.</p>
      <a class="button hero-button" href="/matching">Начать подбор <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <span class="hero-note">Подбор по навыкам и опыту — быстро и прозрачно</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="profile profile-main">
        <span class="avatar avatar-main">АК</span>
        <span class="profile-lines"><b></b><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span class="match-badge">92% совпадение</span>
      </div>
      <div class="profile profile-top">
        <span class="avatar avatar-top">МП</span>
        <span class="profile-lines"><b></b><i></i></span>
      </div>
      <div class="profile profile-bottom">
        <span class="avatar avatar-bottom">ИС</span>
        <span class="profile-lines"><b></b><i></i></span>
      </div>
      <span class="sparkle sparkle-one">✦</span>
      <span class="sparkle sparkle-two">✦</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-intro">
    <div>
      <span class="section-kicker">ВСЁ ДЛЯ ПОДБОРА</span>
      <h2>С чего начнём?</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Выберите нужный раздел — все инструменты уже под рукой.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="workspace-grid" aria-label="Разделы HR Manager">
    <a class="workspace-card" href="/resumes">
      <span class="card-icon resume-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9l-6-6Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M14 3v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      <span class="card-title">База резюме</span>
      <span class="card-description">Храните профили кандидатов, обновляйте навыки и быстро находите нужных специалистов.</span>
      <span class="card-link">Открыть резюме <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>

    <a class="workspace-card" href="/vacancies">
      <span class="card-icon vacancy-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M8 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M3 12h18M10 12v2h4v-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      <span class="card-title">Вакансии</span>
      <span class="card-description">Соберите требования работодателя и держите все открытые позиции в одном месте.</span>
      <span class="card-link">Открыть вакансии <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>

    <a class="workspace-card" href="/matching">
      <span class="card-icon matching-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m15.5 15.5 5 5M8 10.5l1.7 1.7L13.5 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      <span class="card-title">Подбор кандидатов</span>
      <span class="card-description">Сопоставьте резюме с вакансией и сравните кандидатов по проценту соответствия.</span>
      <span class="card-link">Перейти к подбору <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="tip">
    <span class="tip-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
    <p><strong>Простой следующий шаг</strong><br />Добавьте вакансию и запустите подбор — система покажет кандидатов с подходящими навыками и опытом.</p>
    <a href="/vacancies/new" aria-label="Добавить вакансию">Добавить вакансию <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 370px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 52px 7%;
    background: linear-gradient(118deg, #17243d 0%, #23385c 62%, #2e4773 100%);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(23,36,61,.15);
  }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 520px; }
  .eyebrow, .section-kicker { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #acbbd4; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }
  .pulse { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7ee0c3; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(126,224,195,.13); }
  .hero h1 { margin: 22px 0 12px; color: white; font-size: clamp(37px, 5vw, 54px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -2px; }
  .hero h1 span { color: #a9b9ff; }
  .hero-copy > p { max-width: 390px; margin: 0 0 23px; color: #c0cce0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-button { min-height: 46px; padding: 0 18px; background: #5977f4; box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(6,15,34,.2); }
  .hero-button:hover { background: #6a85fa; }
  .hero-button span { font-size: 18px; }
  .hero-note { display: block; margin-top: 14px; color: #9eacc2; font-size: 11px; }
  .hero-art { position: relative; height: 265px; }
  .orbit { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(192,208,255,.16); border-radius: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); }
  .orbit-one { width: 235px; height: 235px; }
  .orbit-two { width: 310px; height: 310px; }
  .profile { position: absolute; z-index: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.72); border-radius: 14px; padding: 12px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 13px 30px rgba(11,21,41,.22); }
  .profile-main { top: 78px; left: 50%; width: 220px; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .profile-top { top: 17px; right: 0; transform: rotate(4deg); }
  .profile-bottom { bottom: 13px; left: 4px; transform: rotate(-4deg); }
  .avatar { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: grid; flex: 0 0 auto; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; color: #3a4d75; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; }
  .avatar-main { background: #e5eaff; }
  .avatar-top { background: #e4f4ef; }
  .avatar-bottom { background: #fff0df; }
  .profile-lines { width: 74px; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .profile-lines b, .profile-lines i { height: 6px; display: block; border-radius: 5px; background: #dce2ed; }
  .profile-lines b { width: 75%; background: #637493; }
  .profile-lines i:nth-child(2) { width: 100%; }
  .match-badge { position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: -12px; border: 2px solid white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 9px; background: #dff5ee; color: #17836e; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 750; }
  .sparkle { position: absolute; color: #9eafff; }
  .sparkle-one { top: 40px; left: 23%; font-size: 20px; }
  .sparkle-two { right: 17%; bottom: 44px; color: #8de0c8; font-size: 15px; }
  .section-intro { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin: 43px 2px 18px; }
  .section-intro h2 { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 24px; }
  .section-kicker { color: #8390a7; font-size: 9px; }
  .section-intro > p { margin: 0 0 4px; color: #8994a8; font-size: 13px; }
  .workspace-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .workspace-card { position: relative; min-height: 232px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; border: 1px solid #e7eaf1; border-radius: 16px; padding: 21px; background: white; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(31,49,82,.035); transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .workspace-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: #cdd7ff; box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(31,49,82,.09); }
  .workspace-card:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #9aabff; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .card-icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 13px; }
  .card-icon svg { width: 23px; height: 23px; }
  .resume-icon { background: #edf0ff; color: #536be0; }
  .vacancy-icon { background: #e8f5f1; color: #28957e; }
  .matching-icon { background: #fff2e5; color: #dc8c38; }
  .card-arrow { position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 23px; color: #a0a9ba; font-size: 17px; transition: color .18s ease, transform .18s ease; }
  .workspace-card:hover .card-arrow { transform: translate(2px,-2px); color: var(--blue); }
  .card-title { margin-top: 18px; color: #202e49; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; }
  .card-description { margin-top: 8px; color: #7e899c; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .card-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 16px; color: #4263eb; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .tip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 18px; border: 1px solid #e5eaf7; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 18px; background: linear-gradient(100deg,#f0f3ff,#f8f9fd); }
  .tip-icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; display: grid; flex: 0 0 auto; place-items: center; border-radius: 10px; background: white; color: #5872e8; }
  .tip p { flex: 1; margin: 0; color: #7c879c; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .tip p strong { color: #34415d; font-size: 12px; }
  .tip a { color: #4263eb; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tip a:hover { color: #263fbc; }
  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .hero { min-height: 350px; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; padding: 38px 5%; }
    .profile-top { right: -12px; }
    .profile-bottom { left: -9px; }
    .workspace-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .workspace-card:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero { min-height: 0; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 34px 25px 20px; }
    .hero-art { height: 220px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .orbit-one { width: 190px; height: 190px; }
    .orbit-two { width: 250px; height: 250px; }
    .profile-main { top: 68px; }
    .profile-top { top: 3px; right: 0; }
    .profile-bottom { bottom: 0; left: 0; }
    .section-intro { display: block; margin-top: 32px; }
    .section-intro > p { margin-top: 7px; }
    .workspace-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .workspace-card:last-child { grid-column: auto; }
    .workspace-card { min-height: 210px; }
    .tip { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tip a { margin-left: 46px; }
  }
</style>
